{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026maDuPNuFjs1794582344.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方趁韓國著名男團BIGBANG在啟德體育園舉行演唱會期間，在主場館一帶採取打擊白牌車行動。</p><p></p><p>警方行動期間，截獲一輛懷疑白牌車，拖走作進一步調查。警方晚上八時半起，封閉馬頭角道的臨時上落客區，這個位置以往供演唱會參加者乘私家車上落。</p><p></p><p>又在土瓜灣道及馬頭角十三街採取特別交通措施，不准停留，並在牛棚藝術村對開設置路障，截查中港車牌私家車，並收集資料。現場亦架設告示，提醒駕駛白牌車違例。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CAR-2230_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QCpvISHXVX1794582356.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:36:23.751447+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:33:31.797203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:29:43.006808+00:00","content_hash":"566368de2b8e6208192878743bc85d3236aea49959d0265f9fa54db7f9fb892d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:36:23.751447+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}